---

<BaseLayout title={page.title} description={page.description} crumbs={crumbs}>
  <PageHeader
    title="Our story: 2017 to today"
    standfirst="From fourteen production companies in Ankole and Kigezi to more than 300 production houses across six sub-regions. Eight years of Western Ugandan film, as recorded."
    crumbs={crumbs}
  />

  {/* The founding photograph carries this page, so it opens the page at full
      bleed with the origin stated over it rather than sitting in a contained
      band above a heading. This is the one image on the site that shows the
      fourteen people the whole association grew from. */}
  <EstablishingShot
    image={pioneers.image}
    alt={pioneers.alt}
    headingId="beginning-heading"
    heading="Fourteen companies, 2017"
    standfirst="In 2017, fourteen film production companies and groups from Ankole and Kigezi registered WUFPA with the Uganda Registration Services Bureau."
    objectPosition="center 40%"
  />

  <Section labelledBy="why-heading" container="narrow" spacing="loose" reveal>
    <h2 id="why-heading">Why they did it</h2>
    <Prose>
      <p>
        They were working in an industry whose training, funding, buyers and policy
        conversations all happened in Kampala — and watching their films copied and sold
        without permission.
      </p>
      <p>
        Both of the association’s founding officers remain involved today, serving on the
        Board of Trustees.
      </p>
    </Prose>
  </Section>

  {/* The arc of the whole page in one line, set dark between the origin and
      the record. Both figures are from [P1] and appear verbatim elsewhere on
      the site; nothing here is a new claim, it is the existing claim given the
      scale the story earns. */}
  <StatementBand
    statement="Fourteen companies in 2017. More than three hundred production houses today."
    source="WUFPA association profile"
    headingId="growth-heading"
    label="How WUFPA grew"
  />

  <Section labelledBy="timeline-heading" variant="subtle" reveal>
    <h2 id="timeline-heading">The record</h2>
    <p class="standfirst">
      Every entry below is drawn from WUFPA’s own association profile. Where an activity is
      documented but carries no date, it is listed separately rather than given a year it does
      not have.
    </p>
    <Timeline entries={entries} class="history-timeline" />
  </Section>

  <Section labelledBy="related-heading" container="narrow" reveal>
    <h2 id="related-heading" class="u-visually-hidden">Where to go next</h2>
    <RelatedLinks
      heading="Elsewhere on this site"
      links={[
        {
          href: '/about/governance/',
          label: 'How WUFPA is governed',
          reason: 'The structure this history built.',
        },
        {
          href: '/programmes/',
          label: 'What we do',
          reason: 'The six areas these activities are organised into today.',
        },
        {
          href: '/impact/',
          label: 'Impact and gallery',
          reason: 'The same eight years, in photographs.',
        },
      ]}
    />
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .history-timeline {
    margin-block-start: var(--space-7);
  }
</style>
